    advanced: "Count cards carefully - this is essential in Manillen. Track which Manilles and Aces have been played. If you know all trumps are gone, your plain suit cards become more valuable. Use 'vet'n' (fattening) - playing high value cards on your partner's winning trick to capture those points safely.",
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "The 'Boeketje Vlaanderen' (Little Flemish Bouquet) - having 2 cards of every suit - is the hardest hand for choosing trumps",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'Remember: 10s are the highest cards, not Aces!',
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'If you have many trumps, consider playing no trump (muulen) for the double score',
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Pay attention to the 'Ik ga mee' - it often indicates the opponent has a strong hand in the trump suit",
      },
